<!--
Template: prompts.html — standalone shell for the wave-execution-prompts page that
`templates/prompts-regen.py` patches in place, every time §7 of execute.md changes.

CAUTION for anyone editing this comment: the script finds its three hooks with a
plain, HTML-oblivious text search (no parser), so it matches the FIRST occurrence
of each marker string anywhere in the file — including inside this comment. Never
spell out the literal marker strings themselves in here (an anchor tag opening
with the nav class, a button opening with the theme id, a section tag opening
with the card class, or the main region's closing tag): doing so once corrupted
a real materialized page during testing, because the script patched THIS comment
instead of the topbar and the placeholder card below it. Describe the hooks only
in prose, the way the rest of this comment does.

This file carries exactly the three hooks the script keys on:
  1. the nav placeholder — a topbar link (anchor element, nav class) for wave W1,
     immediately followed by the theme-toggle button (its id names the toggle).
     The script replaces everything from the start of that first topbar link up
     to (not including) the toggle button with one link per wave (id + status
     mark).
  2. the first placeholder wave card — a section element (card class) below the
     protocol box. The script replaces everything from the start of that section
     up to (not including) the end of the main content region with one card per
     wave (badge, title, and either the wave's own fenced prompt or a "no prompt
     in §7" fallback).
  3. the close of the main content region, right after hook 2's card — the right
     edge of the replacement. Never remove or duplicate it.
Do not rename these elements' classes/ids, and never reproduce their literal
opening/closing tag text elsewhere earlier in this file (comments included).

Placeholder: {{PROJECT_NAME}} — the project/product name shown in the page title
and hero. `prompts-regen.py --init` fills it automatically (from --project, or
the brain directory's parent directory name) the first time it materializes this
file into <out>; after that first run the script only ever touches hooks 1 and 2
above, so {{PROJECT_NAME}} is never touched again — edit the hero by hand if the
name changes later.

Self-contained by design: the only external resource is the Google Fonts
stylesheet below (Montserrat + Inter); everything else — CSS, the copy-to-
clipboard buttons, the light/dark toggle — is inline so the page works from a
plain file:// open with no build step.

The hero copy, protocol box and copy/theme-toggle strings below are written in
Spanish to match this script's default --lang es; if a project runs --lang en,
edit those by hand too (the script only localizes the strings it generates per
wave — the copy-button label, the "no prompt in §7" fallback sentence, and the
"real status" line — via its LANG dict, not this static shell).
-->
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Prompts {{PROJECT_NAME}}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#0f0d09;--surface:#16140f;--raised:#1c1913;--text:#f2ebdd;--muted:#a89f8d;
--border:#2a2620;--border-strong:#3d382e;--gold:#c9a227;--gold-hi:#e3bc45;
--ok:#4fa36b;--warn:#d9a54f;--danger:#d9534f;--code-bg:#14110b;--glass:rgba(15,13,9,.78);--r:12px}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: light){
:root:not([data-theme="dark"]){--bg:#faf7ef;--surface:#ffffff;--raised:#f4efe2;--text:#1c1913;
--muted:#6b6353;--border:#e6dfcd;--border-strong:#cfc6ab;--gold:#a8871f;--gold-hi:#8a6f16;
--ok:#2f7d4e;--warn:#9c6f1e;--danger:#b23c38;--code-bg:#f5f0e0;--glass:rgba(250,247,239,.82)}}
:root[data-theme="light"]{--bg:#faf7ef;--surface:#ffffff;--raised:#f4efe2;--text:#1c1913;
--muted:#6b6353;--border:#e6dfcd;--border-strong:#cfc6ab;--gold:#a8871f;--gold-hi:#8a6f16;
--ok:#2f7d4e;--warn:#9c6f1e;--danger:#b23c38;--code-bg:#f5f0e0;--glass:rgba(250,247,239,.82)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
font:15px/1.65 'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
h1,h2{font-family:'Montserrat',system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em}
code{font:.9em ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace}
.hero{padding:52px 24px 32px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
background:linear-gradient(180deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--gold) 9%,var(--bg)),var(--bg))}
.hero .kicker{font:600 11.5px 'Montserrat',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;
letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--gold)}
.hero h1{margin:6px 0 8px;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,36px)}
.hero p{margin:0 auto;max-width:680px;color:var(--muted)}
.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:9;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;
justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 16px;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
background:var(--glass);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.nav-a,.btn{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--surface);
color:var(--text);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font:500 13px 'Inter',sans-serif}
.nav-a:hover,.btn:hover{border-color:var(--border-strong);text-decoration:none}
.btn:focus-visible,.copy:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:2px}
main{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 24px 96px}
.proto{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);
padding:20px 26px;margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px}
.proto h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:17px}
.proto ul{margin:6px 0;padding-left:20px}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r);
margin:0 0 26px;overflow:hidden}
.card-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;
padding:18px 24px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.card-h h2{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:19px}
.tid{font:700 13px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--gold-hi);margin-right:10px}
.badge{display:inline-block;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px;font-size:11.5px;
font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--raised);color:var(--muted)}
.badge.gate{color:var(--warn);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 45%,transparent);
background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 10%,transparent)}
.badge.ok{color:var(--ok);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok) 45%,transparent);
background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok) 10%,transparent)}
.copy{cursor:pointer;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid var(--gold);background:transparent;
color:var(--gold);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font:600 12.5px 'Inter',sans-serif}
.copy:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--gold) 12%,transparent)}
.copy.done{color:var(--ok);border-color:var(--ok)}
pre{margin:0;padding:20px 24px;background:var(--code-bg);overflow-x:auto;
font:12.2px/1.55 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;tab-size:2}
pre code{font:inherit}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){*{transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="hero">
  <div class="kicker">{{PROJECT_NAME}} · Prompts de ejecución</div>
  <h1>Prompts {{PROJECT_NAME}}</h1>
  <p>Los prompts copy-paste de cada ola, listos para correr en una sesión limpia en modo ejecución.
  Fuente canónica: <code>execute.md §7</code> — si esta página y execute.md difieren, manda execute.md.</p>
</header>
<div class="topbar">
  <a class="nav-a" href="#w1">W1</a>
  <button class="btn" id="theme" aria-label="Cambiar tema">◐</button>
</div>
<main>
  <section class="proto">
    <h2>Cómo se corre una ola (el protocolo en breve)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Sesión limpia en MODO EJECUCIÓN</strong> (auto-accept edits); nunca plan mode — el plan ES el prompt.</li>
      <li>El <strong># SCOPE</strong> embebe la investigación; el <strong>census corre PRIMERO</strong>: si diverge, STOP y re-scope — jamás re-derivar listas.</li>
      <li>El loop sale por <strong>DoD-auto verificable por comando</strong>, no por cansancio (máx 5 rondas; fallos repetidos → reportar).</li>
      <li>Las olas ⚠gate cierran con <strong>verificación adversarial</strong> de alguien que no implementó.</li>
      <li>El cierre corre el doc-sync completo: bitácora + flips de estado + manifests + links.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="card" id="w1">
<header class="card-h"><div><span class="tid">W1</span> <span class="badge pending">☐</span>
<h2>Placeholder — reemplazado por prompts-regen.py</h2></div>
<button class="copy" data-target="pre-w1">Copiar prompt</button></header>
<pre id="pre-w1"><code>Este contenido lo reemplaza prompts-regen.py en cada corrida.</code></pre>
</section>
</main>
<script>
document.getElementById('theme').onclick=()=>{const h=document.documentElement;
h.dataset.theme=h.dataset.theme==='light'?'dark':'light'};
document.querySelectorAll('.copy').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{
const pre=document.getElementById(b.dataset.target);
try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pre.textContent);b.textContent='Copiado ✓';b.classList.add('done');
setTimeout(()=>{b.textContent='Copiar prompt';b.classList.remove('done')},2000)}catch(e){
const r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(pre);const sel=getSelection();
sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);b.textContent='Selecciona y copia (Cmd+C)'}});
</script>
</body>
</html>
